    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=\\log_5(10)-1=\\dfrac{\\ln 10}{\\ln 5}-1$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x+1&=\\log_5(10)\\\\x&=\\log_5(10)-1\\\\x&=\\frac{\\ln 10}{\\ln 5}-1\\end{align*}$$",
